# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# --- Model weights & training state ---
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file >100MB (optimizer.pt here is 155MB,
# adapter_model.safetensors is 99MB but there are ~7 copies across
# sft_output_v4/v5/v6 checkpoints + final_adapter). Intermediate training
# checkpoints (checkpoint-*/) are excluded entirely; only the small metadata
# alongside final_adapter/ (tokenizer, config, README) is kept, not its
# safetensors weight file. Actual weights should be hosted on the HF Hub or
# similar and referenced from the README instead of vendored into git.
*.safetensors
*.pt
*.bin
**/checkpoint-*/
**/runs/

# --- Generated audio ---
# 13G of ground-truth TTS wavs (tts_outputs/) + ~1.1G per speech-inference
# run (speech_outputs_*/) are reproducible from generate_tts_v2.py / the
# inference scripts + final_adapter weights, and are not meant to live in git.
v2/tts_outputs/
**/speech_outputs_*/
*.wav

# --- Vendored third-party reference code ---
# Omni-R1/ is a reference GRPO/RL-on-Omni repo pulled in for the trainer
# implementation, not project code. Keep it out of our history; document the
# upstream source in the README instead.
v2/Omni-R1/

# --- Ambiguous/duplicate scratch folder ---
# "test set/" looks like a manual scratch copy of dataset+tts_outputs made
# 2026-07-05; flagged for the user to confirm purpose before it's ever
# committed.
v2/test set/

# --- Misc ---
.DS_Store
*.egg-info/
